# Stress-ng (stress) (stress-ng) — Kонсольная утилита для стресс-тестирования системы:
# https://github.com/resurrecting-open-source-projects/stress
# https://github.com/ColinIanKing/stress-ng
# https://archlinux.org/packages/extra/x86_64/stress/
